```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[Member Files Dispute] --> B[Reason Code Classification]
    B --> C[Case Opened + Reg Z Clock Starts]
    C --> D{Evidence Assembly\nParallel Fan-Out}
    D --> E[Transaction Store]
    D --> F[Carrier / Tracking]
    D --> G[Merchant Record]
    D --> H[Member History]
    D --> I[Comms Log / Docs]
    E --> J[Evidence Collected]
    F --> J
    G --> J
    H --> J
    I --> J
    J --> K[Hard Rules Evaluation\nHR-1 through HR-4]
    K --> L{Rules Fired?}
    L -->|No| M[Linear Scorecard\n+ Monotonic Stand-in]
    L -->|Yes| N[Route to Human\nwith Rule Override]
    M --> O[Platt Calibration]
    O --> P{Scorecard-GBM\nAgreement?}
    P -->|Agree| Q[Confidence Score]
    P -->|Disagree| N
    Q --> R{Routing Decision}
    R -->|conf >= 0.85\nno rules| S[Auto Resolve]
    R -->|0.55 <= conf < 0.85| T[Proposed Split]
    R -->|conf < 0.55\nor rules fired| N
    S --> U[Narration + Faithfulness Guard]
    T --> U
    N --> V[Full Case File to Agent]
    U --> W[Written Decision Issued]
    W --> X[Both Portals Updated]
    X --> Y[Hash-Chained Ledger Entry]
    V --> Z[Agent Reviews + Override/Approve]
    Z --> Y
